    "The number of people injured in fires attended by the municipal fire and rescue service, where the initiating event was fire or imminent risk of fire in a building.\r\n\r\nInjury severity, sex and age group as assessed by fire officer.\r\n\r\nSee table B36 for normal residence fires by house type.\r\n\r\nNote that more comprehensive and reliable statistics on fire deaths are available in <i>Fire deaths</i>, table A10, A20 and A30."
